    "final_answer": "I apologize, but I don't have a direct file reading tool available in my current set of functions. My available tools are:\n\n- `ask_user` - for asking multiple-choice questions\n- `manage_memory` - for managing memories (add, edit, delete, list, search)\n- `manage_skills` - for managing skills\n- `interplane_capabilities_search` - for searching tool names\n\nSince I cannot directly read docs/history.adoc, could you please:\n\n1. Share the relevant content from the file about the lamp designer, or\n2. Tell me if there's another way to access this information?\n\nAlternatively, if you know who designed the lamp, I can help you save that name to your memory system so you don't forget it."
